    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chamba cha Babele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo v'antu' v'ose mu welelo v'ayombage ki'yombele ki'mo du' na mihayo zyene zizyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' v'enav'o aho v'asamagasamaga ku'fuma lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya, v'afikaga ku' lwandi' lwa Shinali, na kwenu'ko v'awonaga nsi' ngololoku, nav'o v'ikalaga kwenu'ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'iwi'laga ati', “Izi ku'v'ezye matofali ku'gatime moto visoga.” Hene v'av'age na matofali haki'mo na lami ku'leka mawe na wu'longo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'ayombaga, “Ku'zyenge kaya na chamba cha ku'fika ku' ilunde, ki'gele ku'pandi'ke wu'kumalu'ku na ku'manyi'i'ka, ku'leke ku'sambala mu welelo yose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga ki'gele awone i'yo kaya haki'mo na chamba i'cho v'ali'zyenga v'antu' v'enav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayombaga “Nhana v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' v'amo du' na ki'yombele ki'mo, nav'o v'alamulaga ku'v'ezya lyeni'li', gi'si' ki'la ndaka i'yo v'aku'loma yi'ku'gelani'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya niswe ku'sooke, ku'kav'asali'nkanie ki'yombele chav'o ki'gele v'aleke kwidegeleka v'av'o ku' v'av'o.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'asambazyaga v'antu' v'enav'o mu welelo yose, na henanho v'alekaga ku'zyenga kaya yeni'yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo henanho v'ahitanaga “Babele",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Babele” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'sali'nkania.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” nguno henanho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'asali'nkaniaga ki'yombele cha v'antu' mu welelo, na ku'fuma henanho wav'asambazyaga v'aye mu welelo yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Shemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'yi' hu' mmola yamwa Shemu na wu'v'yalwa wakwe. Ku'fuma aho yav'i'taga kamilamasenga, zyav'i'taga myaka iv'i'li', Shemu wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo, na wapandi'kaga mwana lina Alifakisadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Alifakisadi, Shemu wikalaga myaka magana atano. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
